WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,290 --> 00:00:09,440
Everyone has read the document

2
00:00:09,440 --> 00:00:11,440
The situation is more serious than we thought

3
00:00:11,440 --> 00:00:12,440
next few months

4
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:14,440
Food supply will be significantly reduced in the plan

5
00:00:14,440 --> 00:00:15,440
Such a big gap

6
00:00:15,440 --> 00:00:17,440
There are nearly two thousand workers in our factory

7
00:00:17,440 --> 00:00:18,440
plus family members

8
00:00:18,440 --> 00:00:19,440
What to do with thousands of mouths?

9
00:00:19,440 --> 00:00:21,440
Relying solely on the reduced food supply

10
00:00:21,440 --> 00:00:22,440
It’s hard to guarantee even basic food rations

11
00:00:22,440 --> 00:00:24,440
Not to mention workers who do heavy physical work

12
00:00:24,440 --> 00:00:26,440
There aren't many reserves in the warehouse to begin with.

13
00:00:26,440 --> 00:00:28,440
Do you really want to continue like this?

14
00:00:28,440 --> 00:00:29,440
The cafeteria won't last long

15
00:00:29,440 --> 00:00:34,220
Section Chief Gao

16
00:00:34,220 --> 00:00:36,220
The Purchasing Department is the window of the factory to the outside world

17
00:00:36,220 --> 00:00:38,220
I don’t ask about the process now

18
00:00:38,220 --> 00:00:40,220
As long as the result is coarse food

19
00:00:40,220 --> 00:00:41,220
sweet potato potatoes

20
00:00:41,220 --> 00:00:42,220
As long as it can fill your stomach

21
00:00:42,220 --> 00:00:43,220
Find a way

22
00:00:43,220 --> 00:00:44,220
If you have any difficulties, ask them now

23
00:00:44,220 --> 00:00:51,080
The factory fully supports the director

24
00:00:51,080 --> 00:00:52,140
I think of someone

25
00:00:52,140 --> 00:00:54,140
Maybe someone has a way

26
00:00:54,140 --> 00:00:56,140
On a sunny day when our Purchasing Department just became a full-time employee, he

27
00:00:56,140 --> 00:00:57,140
He can get food

28
00:00:57,140 --> 00:00:58,140
I dare not guarantee

29
00:00:58,140 --> 00:01:00,140
But this young man has a bright future
